Hi

While building randconfig kernels with today's linux-next I ran into
this :

drivers/built-in.o: In function
moxa_pci_probe':moxa.c:(.devinit.text+0x76d8): undefined reference to
request_firmware'
:moxa.c:(.devinit.text+0x7e6e): undefined reference to release_firmware=
'
make: *** [.tmp_vmlinux1] Error 1

I think the problem is present in Linus tree.

Please do tell me if this kind of problem report is useless or sent to
the wrong destination.

Philippe

